### 📊 Session 3 – Introduction to R with a Bioinformatics Focus
This session includes:

Development of Task 03 in Markdown format with R exercises [Tarea_03](https://github.com/maluflorezg/Tareas_BioinfRepro2025_MLFG/blob/main/Unidad1/Sesion_3/Tarea_03_Martha_Florez.md)
